  "title": "Phoenix New Media to Announce Third quarter 2025 Financial Results on Wednesday, November 12, 2025",
  "summary": "BEIJING, Nov. 6, 2025 – Phoenix New Media Limited (“Phoenix New Media”, “ifeng” or the “Company”) (NYSE: FENG), a leading new media company in China, today announced that it will report its third quarter 2025 financial results on Wednesday, November 12, 2025 after the U.S. market closes.",
